%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% requires: resident-outlines
% expect-output: 130.656
% expect-output: 72.0
% divergence: resident-inventory
% Scenario: resident charpath. Times-Roman outlines come from the
% Liberation Serif asset; (Ab) at size 48 from (72, 72) advances the
% current point by the AFM widths 722 and 500, and the fill paints the
% two outlines as one path with no text operation; the golden pins the
% outlines.
% Expect: 130.656 and 72.0, then one page.
/r { 1000 mul round 1000 div } def
/Times-Roman findfont 48 scalefont setfont
72 72 moveto (Ab) false charpath
currentpoint r exch r = =
fill
showpage
